      "oa:hasSelector": [
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "Consequently, no changes or alterations to the INs may be made unilaterally at passport agencies/centers without the approval of CA/PPT/S/A except in extenuating circumstances on a case-by-case basis with the approval of passport agency/center management, e.g., when using an endorsement 46 to limit a passport for a special problem."
        },
